          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" defaultTabSize="72"><strong><span color="rgba(90, 107, 125, 1)" fontSize="21.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">脑 → 词</span></strong></p>
