          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:18.00" defaultTabSize="72"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="12.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">识别的是刺激本身：这个人听到了哪个词。仍然接近 stimulus recognition。</span></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
