      <shape width="404.1359842519685" height="67.68" topLeftX="486.72" topLeftY="184.32" type="text" id="bMB">
        <content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:18.00" defaultTabSize="72"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="12.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">重建的是这个人理解到的内容。更接近高层级的认知表征，也更接近意识研究关心的东西。</span></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="870.6959842519685" height="37.2" topLeftX="44.639999999999986" topLeftY="273.6" type="text" id="bMj">
        <content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" defaultTabSize="72"><strong><span color="rgba(15, 58, 87, 1)" fontSize="14" fontFamily="Heiti SC" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">意识体验往往不是感官像素，而是整合后的语义与概念内容——所以语义层面的「差不多」，比逐词正确率更接近我们真正想读的东西。</span></strong></p>
        </content>
