          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:18.50" defaultTabSize="72"><strong><span color="rgba(27, 140, 153, 1)" fontSize="13.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">指标选择本身就是立场</span></strong></p>
        </content>
