      <shape width="237.43196850393701" height="70.56" topLeftX="64.80000000000001" topLeftY="381.6" type="text" id="bMh">
        <content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:16.50" defaultTabSize="72"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="11.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">不同词可以表达同一意思（“we were busy” 与 “we had a lot of work”），所以用 BERTScore 这类意义相似度衡量；用 WER 衡量会系统性低估这套系统的价值。</span></p>
